undColor=#FFFFFF;labelBorderColor=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c32" target="c34"><mxGeometry x="0.0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="Flows" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D1D5DB;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2937;container=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="630" width="570" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="&lt;font color=&#x27;#0078D4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Analysts → Web App: HTTPS, loads the React app (static files only)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#0078D4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Analysts → Function App /api/*: HTTPS with an Entra access token&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(MSAL sign-in, scope Board.Access); CORS allows only the web origin&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#0078D4&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Agents → MCP /runtime/webhooks/mcp with an app-only Entra token,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;validated and role-checked on every tool call&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Function App → PostgreSQL: TLS, Entra token as the password&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#0F766E&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Read: incident poller, advanced hunting, entity lookups&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#x27;#B91C1C&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; Write: containment only after policy + human approval&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Reference agent → Foundry Messages API with an Entra token&lt;br&gt;Sign-in goes to Microsoft Entra ID (login.microsoftonline.com).&lt;br&gt;The Function App reaches storage and Application Insights with its&lt;br&gt;managed identity; no shared keys or connection secrets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agents hold &lt;b&gt;no&lt;/b&gt; Microsoft security permissions. No hop uses a stored secret." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215" y="660" width="545" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="Azure icons © Microsoft, used unmodified under the Azure architecture icon terms. Microsoft Graph, Defender XDR and the Defender for Endpoint API have no Azure architecture icon, so they are drawn as plain cards." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#4B5563;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1170" width="1100" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>